@App2.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5155
@ContextId = demo-context

### Agent card (A2A discovery)
GET {{App2.API_HostAddress}}/a2a/weather/card
Accept: application/json

### A2A HTTP+JSON - mesaj gonder (tek seferlik yanit)
POST {{App2.API_HostAddress}}/a2a/weather/message:send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": {
    "kind": "message",
    "role": "ROLE_USER",
    "parts": [
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "Ankara icin bugunku hava durumu nasil?"
      }
    ],
    "messageId": "msg-1",
    "contextId": "{{ContextId}}"
  }
}

### A2A HTTP+JSON - ayni konusmaya devam et (contextId ayni)
POST {{App2.API_HostAddress}}/a2a/weather/message:send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": {
    "kind": "message",
    "role": "ROLE_USER",
    "parts": [
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "Peki yarin icin ne dersin?"
      }
    ],
    "messageId": "msg-2",
    "contextId": "{{ContextId}}"
  }
}

### A2A HTTP+JSON - streaming yanit (SSE)
POST {{App2.API_HostAddress}}/a2a/weather/message:stream
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "message": {
    "kind": "message",
    "role": "ROLE_USER",
    "parts": [
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "Izmir icin hafta sonu hava durumu nasil?"
      }
    ],
    "messageId": "msg-3",
    "contextId": "{{ContextId}}"
  }
}

### A2A HTTP+JSON - task listesi
GET {{App2.API_HostAddress}}/a2a/weather/tasks
Accept: application/json

### Klasik minimal API endpoint'i (A2A disi)
POST {{App2.API_HostAddress}}/agents/weather
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Antalya icin hava durumu nasil?"
}

###
